# 任务标签功能 - 系统架构图

## 整体架构

```mermaid
graph TB
    subgraph "前端层 Frontend"
        A1[TagManager.vue<br/>标签管理]
        A2[TaskTags.vue<br/>任务标签]
        A3[TagFilter.vue<br/>标签筛选]
    end

    subgraph "API 层 API Layer"
        B1[TagController<br/>POST /api/tags<br/>PUT /api/tags/{id}<br/>DELETE /api/tags/{id}<br/>GET /api/tags]
        B2[TodoTagController<br/>POST /api/todos/{id}/tags<br/>DELETE /api/todos/{id}/tags/{tagId}]
    end

    subgraph "服务层 Service Layer"
        C1[TagService<br/>validateName<br/>checkUnique]
        C2[TodoTagService<br/>addTags<br/>removeTags<br/>queryByTags]
    end

    subgraph "数据层 Data Layer"
        D1[TagMapper<br/>BaseMapper]
        D2[TodoTagMapper<br/>BaseMapper]
        D3[(MySQL<br/>t_tag<br/>t_todo_tag)]
    end

    subgraph "缓存 Cache"
        E1[(Redis<br/>标签缓存<br/>TTL: 5min)]
    end

    A1 -->|HTTP/REST| B1
    A2 -->|HTTP/REST| B2
    A3 -->|HTTP/REST| B1

    B1 --> C1
    B2 --> C1
    B2 --> C2

    C1 -->|查询| D1
    C1 -->|查询| E1
    C2 -->|插入/删除| D2
    C2 -->|查询| D2

    D1 --> D3
    D2 --> D3
    E1 -.->|未命中| D1
```

## 创建标签时序

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as 用户
    participant V as TagManager.vue
    participant C as TagController
    participant S as TagService
    participant M as TagMapper
    participant DB as MySQL
    participant R as Redis

    U->>V: 输入: "工作", "#FF6B6B"
    V->>C: POST /api/tags {name, color}

    C->>S: createTag(dto, userId)
    S->>S: 校验名称1-20字符
    S->>S: 校验颜色HEX格式

    S->>R: 查询缓存中是否存在
    R-->>S: 返回结果

    S->>M: SELECT COUNT(*) FROM t_tag<br/>WHERE user_id=? AND name=?
    M->>DB: 执行查询
    DB-->>M: 返回计数

    M-->>S: count=0 (唯一)

    S->>M: INSERT INTO t_tag<br/>(user_id, name, color)
    M->>DB: 执行插入
    DB-->>M: 返回自增ID

    M-->>S: TagEntity{id=1}
    S->>R: 删除用户标签缓存
    S-->>C: TagVO{id=1, name, color}
    C-->>V: 200 OK {data: TagVO}
    V-->>U: 刷新标签列表
```

## 标签筛选时序

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as 用户
    participant F as TagFilter.vue
    participant C as TodoController
    participant S as TodoService
    participant M as TodoMapper
    participant TM as TodoTagMapper
    participant DB as MySQL

    U->>F: 选择标签 [1, 3]
    F->>C: GET /api/todos?tagIds=1,3

    C->>S: queryTodos(tagIds, userId)
    S->>M: SELECT * FROM t_todo<br/>WHERE user_id=?<br/>AND EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM<br/>t_todo_tag WHERE todo_id=t.id<br/>AND tag_id IN (1,3)<br/>HAVING COUNT(*)=2)

    M->>TM: 查询标签详情
    TM->>DB: SELECT * FROM t_tag<br/>WHERE id IN (SELECT tag_id<br/>FROM t_todo_tag<br/>WHERE todo_id IN (...))
    DB-->>TM: 标签列表

    M-->>S: TodoEntity[] with tags
    S-->>C: TodoVO[]
    C-->>F: 200 OK {rows, total}
    F-->>U: 显示筛选结果
```

## 数据模型关系

```mermaid
erDiagram
    User ||--o{ Tag : "创建"
    User ||--o{ Todo : "创建"
    Tag ||--o{ TodoTag : "关联"
    Todo ||--o{ TodoTag : "关联"

    User {
        bigint id PK
        string username
        string password
    }

    Tag {
        bigint id PK
        bigint user_id FK
        string name
        string color
    }

    Todo {
        bigint id PK
        bigint user_id FK
        string title
        int status
    }

    TodoTag {
        bigint id PK
        bigint todo_id FK
        bigint tag_id FK
    }
```

